{
  "id": "S12",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Cylindrical insulation and critical radius",
    "subject": "Heat transfer",
    "objectives": [
      "Bracket on each side of rc, report all thicknesses for a target magnitude; impose any space cap after solving. At zero driving force no unique insulation design."
